WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
combined solution, combined solution

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:03,040
Settlement of accounts, settlement of accounts, one code, one code

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:04,840
Then you beat me and my mother

4
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:05,960
You also have to pay us for medical expenses

5
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,080
I'm calling it self-defense. That's bullshit for you.

6
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:11,770
Let me tell you, Li Qinghe, if you don’t pay me

7
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:13,570
I don't mind doing the same thing as last time

8
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:23,060
Go to Lijiacun in person and say countdown to hell.

9
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:30,700
Chen Meng, please help me

10
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:31,940
Only then can our family seek justice.

11
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:35,020
This is a little thought. I'm not respectful. You can use this money.

12
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:36,340
Self-inflicted Lotus Lantern

13
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:47,440
Used to worship the Dragon King, good, good, good Su Yuan

14
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:49,160
I want to thank you for protecting the big duck and the two ducks

15
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:50,960
Just encounter something like this again

16
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:53,560
Just ask the people around you to help call the police and don’t be harsh with them.

17
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,760
You're just a half-grown boy facing two adults

18
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:59,920
I will definitely suffer if I insist on it. I want to talk to uncle with my fists like my uncle.

19
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:04,080
If you hadn't been in front of so many people today, you would have taken out the samurai, right?
